{"title":"전생하니 시어머니가 29명","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=jWcP6/hAC1RpaU9k/QdLGkjdpKXrouT6VFrbfz0&filename=th3","synopsis":"역사덕후가 고려로 갔더니 왕건의 예비 며느리가 되었다?!\n\n명문대 사학도 취준생 김선우. 조깅하다 싱크 홀에 빠져 눈을 떠보니 후삼국 시대 호족의 딸 연우가 되어있다.\n그런데 갑자기 태자와 혼인해야 한다니? 역사에 따르면, 태자는 즉위 후 2년 만에 죽고, 연우는 궁에 갇혀 쓸쓸히 생을 마감하는데…\n\n“이 혼사는 반드시 피해야만 한다!”\n\n그런데, 혼사를 피하려다 오히려 공을 세워 예비 시아버지(왕건)의 눈에 띄어 버렸습니다…?\n태자가 생각보다 너무 잘 생겼습니다…?\n연우는 과연 태자비가 될 운명을 피할 수 있을까?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":259,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":211,"change":{"type":"up","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":294,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":271,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":233,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":233,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":222,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":247,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":214,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":230,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":177,"change":{"type":"up","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":202,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-09-21","ra